# retrocrt — waylock colors for HikaruWM
# Canonical palette: ../../palette
#
# Hikaru's hikaru-lock script hardcodes these three flags in its final line:
#   exec waylock -init-color 0x000000 -input-color 0x202020 -fail-color 0x8b0000 "$@"
# Replace the three values with the ones below (copy hikaru-lock to
# ~/.local/bin or edit the installed one). Colors only. waylock takes 0xRRGGBB.

-init-color 0x0a0e14
-input-color 0x00d4c8
-fail-color 0xe05050
